# (g) Star-import facade migration — src/X.py is a `from clawcodex_ext.X import *`
# facade (or `globals().update()` for modules with underscore-prefixed names), and
# src/<pkg>/__init__.py keeps a small fork delta (the upstream archive-placeholder
# SNAPSHOT_PATH/ARCHIVE_NAME metadata depends on the file location in src/, so it
# stays in src/ rather than being moved to clawcodex_ext/). Distinct from (d)
# (clawcodex_ext mirrors upstream 1:1) and (f) (Pattern C sys.modules-swap). Run
# regenerate after adding/removing entries; series/0573f4c_series will skip these
# files.
